@startuml lld-us4-sequence
title LLD-US4 Lock access after 3 failed logins: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant AuthService
participant Lockout
participant SmsGateway
AuthService -> Lockout : fail(10023456)
Lockout -> Lockout : failedCount = 3
Lockout -> Lockout : lockedUntil = now + 24 h
Lockout -> SmsGateway : "Net banking locked"
@enduml